	(text "DUAL 12-BIT 10 MSPS ADC (LTC2290). VDD = OVDD = +3V0 (LDO, switched on after USB enumeration).\nSENSE = VDD: internal ref, 2 Vpp differential full scale. MUX = VDD: ch A on DA bus, ch B on DB bus.\nMODE = 2/3 VDD (R301/R302): two's-complement output, clock duty-cycle stabilizer ON.\nOE and SHDN tied low: both channels always enabled. OVDD = 3.0 V is a valid LVCMOS33 input level for the FPGA.\nX301: 10 MHz low-jitter MEMS oscillator (~1 ps rms phase jitter) clocks both ADC channels and the FPGA (CLK_10M)."
		(at 121.92 182.88 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
